    "methodCode": "def chi_cdf(x,nu):\n if x<=0:return 0.\n t=x/2\n if nu%2==0:\n  term=1.;acc=1.\n  for j in range(1,nu//2):term*=t/j;acc+=term\n  return max(0.,min(1.,1.-math.exp(-t)*acc))\n ans=math.erf(math.sqrt(t));s=.5\n for _ in range((nu-1)//2):ans-=math.exp(-t+s*math.log(t)-math.lgamma(s+1));s+=1\n return max(0.,min(1.,ans))\ndef inv(func,p,hi):\n lo=0.\n for _ in range(100):\n  mid=(lo+hi)/2\n  if func(mid)<p:lo=mid\n  else:hi=mid\n return (lo+hi)/2\n",
    "normalQuantilesNote": "末行x_p是原书给出的近似正态分位点，照录；本次112项复算针对16×7卡方临界值。"
